# Allowlist: the image build reads only the workspace manifest, its lock, the crates and
# vendor/ (cargo reads every path dependency's manifest, even one the build does not compile).
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/
!vendor/
**/target
**/.worktrees
**/.env
**/.env.*
# The redaction denylist holds real secret literals; it must never enter an image.
**/.secrets-denylist
